<title>HONG KONG: East Asiatic H1 net loss HK$13.54 mln.</title>
<headline>East Asiatic H1 net loss HK$13.54 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.3 loss   vs 8.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  28.24 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    13.54 loss vs 35.33 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     971.68     vs 725.91</p>
<p>    Company name		 East Asiatic Co (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - A shipping and wholesale group.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on diposal of two leasehold properties for HK$23.97 million and HK$4.27 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
